  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding with singleprofile settings, without image modalities or fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 score of 0.464 establish a baseline for RNA-only performance. The impact of alternative encoders or multimodal configurations remains uncertain without comparative evidence."
}

